# The build context is the repo root; only the server, the web client and
# the shared JavaScript core go into the image. Everything else (mobile
# apps, docs, git) is left out.
*
!apps/server/requirements.txt
!apps/server/app/
!apps/web/
!packages/core/walletweather-core.js

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.DS_Store
